# Before a push

CI's Ruff job (`.github/workflows/publish.yml`) installs a pinned ruff
and fails on any lint or formatting difference. Before every push of
mu-image, run from the repo root, with the version the workflow pins:

```sh
python3 -m venv /tmp/ruff-ci
/tmp/ruff-ci/bin/pip install "ruff==<version in publish.yml>"
/tmp/ruff-ci/bin/ruff check
/tmp/ruff-ci/bin/ruff format --check
```

Apply what `ruff format --check` reports with the edit tools, not with
`ruff format`, which rewrites tracked files outside the review pane.
